# generated diagrams (xo-deps.svg, xo-loc.svg, ..) are build output
*.svg
# .. but docs assets are source.  Without these, a figure committed in .rst with an
# untracked .svg builds green and 404s on the published site: sphinx only warns.
!**/docs/_static/img/*.svg
!_static/img/*.svg
